        "TileImage": "$($repository 486c204d-773b-4103-b4f4-829a3d944161).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. Your primary targets are Zachary Croft and Jewel Warrick, a five-year couple and the founders of a major toy manufacturing company in England. They are also notorious for manufacturing a toy called &quot;Howard Express no. 1&quot;, a toy rocket ship known for exploding at large gatherings and Christmas parties. So far, 19 children have died from the toy, but production hasn&apos;t stopped. Our client wants the couple and one of their suppliers, Sebastian Sato, eliminated. Good luck, 47.",
